# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# webrtc-demo .gitignore
#
# 约定（见 doc/05 §9.0）：
#   third_party/libvpx-src/      = libvpx 源码 submodule（跟踪）
#   third_party/libwebrtc-src/   = libwebrtc 源码 submodule（跟踪）
#   third_party/libvpx/          = libvpx 编译产物（lib/include），忽略
#   third_party/libwebrtc/       = libwebrtc 编译产物（lib/include/java），忽略
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ===== libwebrtc / libvpx 编译产物（体积大，不入库）=====
third_party/libwebrtc/
third_party/libvpx/
third_party/android_toolchain/
third_party/*.zip

# ===== 构建系统（depot_tools / gn / ninja 输出）=====
build/
out/
depot_tools/
.gclient
.gclient_entries
gn_args.gni

# ===== Android / Gradle =====
.gradle/
**/build/
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
*.iml
.idea/
.kotlin/

# ===== 签名与密钥（严禁入库）=====
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ===== Go 信令服务编译产物（只忽略二进制，绝不忽略 signaling/ 源码目录）=====
# 修复 C23/R7：原裸模式 `signaling` 会命中整个 signaling/ 目录 → Go 全部源码静默不入库。
# 必须使用带前导斜杠的精确路径（相对仓库根）。
/signaling/signaling
/signaling/signaling-linux-amd64
/signaling/dist/
/signaling/logs/

# ===== 通用 =====
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log

# ===== 明确保留（必须放在最后：后面的规则优先级更高，避免被 *.a/*.so 等再次忽略）=====
!reports/
!reports/**
!doc/
!doc/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!**/CMakeLists.txt
!**/*.cpp
!**/*.h
!**/*.kts
!**/*.kt

# ⚠️ 必须放在整个文件最末：`!reports/**` 会把 reports/ 下一切重新纳入，所以忽略规则若放前面会被它覆盖。
# （目录级 `/reports/logs/` 无效，因为 `!reports/**` 会重新包含它；必须用内容级 `*` 模式。）
/reports/logs/*
/signaling/logs/*
